            "counter_evidence": null,
            "explanation": "The loop iterates directly over the live mapping. When an encountered value is None, line 4 deletes that key from the same mapping, changing its size while its iterator is active. For a built-in dict, advancing that iterator after the deletion raises RuntimeError: dictionary changed size during iteration. The supplied diff also shows that the previous list(values) snapshot was replaced by live iteration, removing the protection against this failure."
